 ## Лицензия
 
 [MIT](LICENSE). Шрифт Caveat - [SIL Open Font License](Resources/OFL.txt).
+
+## Language / Язык
+
+The interface is available in Russian and English. Choose it in Settings → Look → Language ("Same as system", English or Русский); the change applies after a restart. Strings live in `Resources/en.lproj` and `Resources/ru.lproj`; the Russian text in the code is the lookup key (`L("...")`). To add a language, copy `en.lproj` to `<code>.lproj`, translate the values, add the code to `Localization.available` and to `CFBundleLocalizations` in `Resources/Info.plist`.
+
+Voice input (FlowLocal / GigaAM) recognizes Russian speech only.
